  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub-National Governance Programme II- Citizen Perception Survey and Governance Analytical Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this new intervention, UNDP will provide technical assistance (TA) to the Government of Sindh for improving its planning and budgeting systems and capacities to manage concurrent crises, including support to improve risk governance preparedness before the onset of the monsoon this summer. The TA team will work with key departments at provincial level as well as in pilot districts for developing and implementing a risk governance framework for disaster preparedness and response through a) contingency budget allocation for ex-ante disaster risk management, and b) transparency in funds utilization in ex-post response and recovery activities. This is a time-bound activity from now till August 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
